    "title": "Open ocean after the lagoon",
    "p1": "Foum El Bouir sits on the Atlantic side of the peninsula — a change of mood from the lagoon’s flat water to open ocean swell and wider horizons.",
    "p2": "Riders come for waves; others come for the walk and the contrast. Conditions change with swell and wind; ask locally before entering the water.",
    "p3": "Bring sun protection and water; services are lighter than at the main lagoon camps."
